{"id":435,"date":"2023-01-25T14:41:11","date_gmt":"2023-01-25T14:41:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/personal-banking\/banking\/lending\/home-loans\/conventional-loans\/"},"modified":"2023-03-27T16:43:39","modified_gmt":"2023-03-27T16:43:39","slug":"conventional-loans","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/lending\/home-loans\/conventional-loans\/","title":{"rendered":"Conventional Loans"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h1>Conventional mortgages, incredible service<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p>If you&#8217;re purchasing or refinancing a home, consider our mortgage options with various term lengths. We offer mortgages for primary residence, second homes, seasonal homes and even some investment properties. Let\u2019s discuss what\u2019s right for you.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group is-style-testimonial\">\n<p><strong>I wanted to thank you for all your work and support in helping us purchase our first home. I cannot express how happy and blessed I was to have you as my power team\u2026you\u2019ve made us the happiest couple in the world right now. <\/strong><br><em>&#8211; Jennifer<\/em><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-btn-dark\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.mymortgage-online.com\/loan-app\/?siteId=8456065592&amp;lar=mmorrell&amp;workFlowId=23826\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">GET STARTED WITH YOUR LOAN<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Already started? <a href=\"https:\/\/idp.elliemae.com\/authorize?client_id=srtrz0d2&amp;site_id=8456065592&amp;response_type=code&amp;redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fchelseagroton.mymortgage-online.com%2Fborrower-app%2Flogin%2F%3FsiteId%3D8456065592&amp;scope=ccbp%20cc&amp;instance_id=be11173852&amp;logo_url=https%3A%2F%2Fasset-service-bucket-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com%2F7f374b2c-540b-416f-a899-84ca75e40a3f&amp;logo_alt_text=Logo&amp;bust=198&amp;apiBaseUrl=https:\/\/api.elliemae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Complete your application<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-light-orange-background-color has-background\"><strong>Fixed Rate Mortgage<\/strong>&nbsp;\u2014 Once you lock in an interest rate, your mortgage rate will remain the same throughout the duration of the home loan. Since payments will be consistent each month, a homeowner can budget around this fixed cost. <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/rates\/\">Terms of 8, 15, 20 and 30 years<\/a> are available. Need a different term-length? Let\u2019s talk. We offer an <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/lending\/home-loans\/specialty-financing-solutions\/\">option to pay biweekly<\/a> too.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-light-orange-background-color has-background\"><strong>Adjustable Rate Mortgages (ARM)<\/strong> \u2014 Looking for lower payments for a fixed number of years? If you don\u2019t intend to hold your mortgage for the long term, anticipate a potential drop in income or expect liabilities to shrink over the life of your loan, an ARM might be the right vehicle for you. Featuring lower interest rates for a fixed period, Averon Trust ARMs are available for fixed periods of 1, 3, 5, 7 and 10 years.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Get a mortgage pre-approval by contacting one of our <a href=\"#mortgage-lenders\">experienced mortgage lenders<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-container-6 wp-block-columns is-style-info-block-tall\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"255\" height=\"505\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/PB_RL_Conventional.Mortgage.jpg\" alt=\"A full body portrait of a smiling woman and man on a front porch\" class=\"wp-image-4246\" srcset=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/PB_RL_Conventional.Mortgage.jpg 255w, https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/PB_RL_Conventional.Mortgage-151x300.jpg 151w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 255px) 100vw, 255px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-style-center-vertical\" style=\"padding-top:3rem;padding-right:3rem;padding-bottom:3rem;padding-left:3rem;flex-basis:75%\">\n<h2>Ready to buy or refinance?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>If you\u2019re ready to get a mortgage or refinance, you can <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.mymortgage-online.com\/loan-app\/?siteId=8456065592&amp;lar=mmorrell&amp;workFlowId=23826\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">apply online<\/a>, or come into any branch or reach out to any mortgage lender on our Residential Lending Team, below.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-btn-secondary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/rates\/\">CHECK RATES<\/a><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-btn-secondary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.mymortgage-online.com\/loan-app\/?siteId=8456065592&amp;lar=mmorrell&amp;workFlowId=23826\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Apply Now<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"mortgage-lenders\">Residential Lending Team<\/h2>\n\n\n<section data-block_daf150c9cfc9167f67e584056bd01ef2 class=\"team-member align\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n                      <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n          <div class=\"team-member-card\">\n      <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/our-team\/marta-amor-baker\/\">\n      <img width=\"400\" height=\"400\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Marta-Amor-Baker-WEB.jpg\" class=\"card-img-top wp-post-image\" alt=\"Marta Amor